[
  {
    "id": "intro-ui",
    "name": "Introduction to the UI",
    "description": "A quick walkthrough of the main interface panels.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "title": "Agent Section",
        "markdownText": "Active agents are here.",
        "targetControlId": "ActiveAgentItemsControl",
        "calloutPlacement": "Auto",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 0.5,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.5
      },
      {
        "title": "Inactive Agents",
        "markdownText": "The rest of the team is here.",
        "targetControlId": "InactiveAgentsScrollViewer",
        "calloutPlacement": "Auto",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 0.038011695906432746,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.47674528156498536
      },
      {
        "title": "The Prompt Box",
        "markdownText": "Your AI prompts go here.",
        "targetControlId": "PromptTextBox",
        "calloutPlacement": "North",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [
          "TypeIntoPrompt|What is your model?|Sim"
        ],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 0.0594541910331384,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.43030945419102895
      },
      {
        "title": "The send button.",
        "markdownText": "Press **Enter** or click this button to send your prompt to Squad.",
        "targetControlId": "RunButton",
        "calloutPlacement": "North",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [],
        "commandsAfter": [
          "Remove Dummy Queue Items"
        ],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 0.5,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.5
      },
      {
        "title": "Transcript.",
        "markdownText": "The **transcript** shows your prompts and agent responses.",
        "targetControlId": "MainTranscriptBorder",
        "calloutPlacement": "North",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [
          "InjectTranscriptTurn|What is your model?|This is the guided tour (so AI model information is not available).\\nAI calls are simulated for the tour."
        ],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 0.043859649122807015,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.27675198235539844
      },
      {
        "title": "Quick reply buttons.",
        "markdownText": "AI responses may include **Quick Reply Buttons**.\r\nClick with the mouse (or press \u0022**[**\u0022 in an empty prompt textbox) to send the button\u0027s reply back to AI.",
        "targetControlId": "TourQuickReplyPanel",
        "calloutPlacement": "East",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [
          "InjectTranscriptTurn|Can you fix these bugs?|Working on it now. \\nThe user wants me to simulate an AI call that fixes simulated bugs.\\nMaking tool calls (simulated)...\\nFixing bugs.\\nDone.\\nThe bugs are fixed.\\n",
          "InjectTranscriptTextWithReplies|What would you like to do next (simulated)?|Add Test Cases|Commit Changes"
        ],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "QuickReplySelected",
        "targetOffsetX": 0.7846003898635477,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.4717917649167319
      },
      {
        "title": "Tooling.",
        "markdownText": "Agent tool calls let you see what\u0027s happening while agents work.",
        "targetControlId": "TourInjectedToolingBlock",
        "calloutPlacement": "Auto",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [
          "InjectTranscriptTurn| Can you take a look at my config file and add a new empty line to it?",
          "InjectTranscriptTools: view:Read Config.cs:// file contents\\nline 2;powershell:Build project:Build succeeded;edit:Update Config.cs: \u002B new line added (simulated)"
        ],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 0.5,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.5
      },
      {
        "title": "Prompts navigation.",
        "markdownText": "Use these to see past prompts.",
        "targetControlId": "PromptNavUpButton",
        "calloutPlacement": "North",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 0.5,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.5
      },
      {
        "title": "The Queue Tab Strip",
        "markdownText": "This is the **Prompt Queue**. \r\nYou can right-click or **drag** tabs to reorder.",
        "targetControlId": "QueueTabStrip[3]",
        "calloutPlacement": "East",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [
          "Add Dummy Queue Items"
        ],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 1,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.46410256410256395
      },
      {
        "title": "Queue drainage",
        "markdownText": "To edit a prompt in the queue, just click its tab. \r\nProcessing will pause while the tab is active.",
        "targetControlId": "QueueTabStrip[3]",
        "calloutPlacement": "East",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [],
        "commandsAfter": [
          "Remove Dummy Queue Items"
        ],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 1,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.410000000000001
      },
      {
        "title": "Edit menu",
        "markdownText": "The Edit menu contains commands for composing prompts and creating markdown documents.",
        "targetControlId": "EditMenuItem_Popup",
        "calloutPlacement": "Auto",
        "preAction": "None",
        "commandBefore": "",
        "commandAfter": "",
        "commandsBefore": [
          "OpenMenu: EditMenuItem"
        ],
        "commandsAfter": [],
        "advanceTrigger": "",
        "targetOffsetX": 0,
        "targetOffsetY": 0.7657692307692318
      },
      {
        "title": "Welcome to the Guided Tour",
        "markdownText": "Meet SquadDash...\r\nStart by clicking the **Next** button below.",
        "targetControlId": "",
        "calloutPlacement": "Auto",
        "preAction": "None",
